ent-STBreacherArmorM40 = M40 experimental armor
    .desc = A custom set of M40 armor designed for use by USCM breacher specialists. Contains thick kevlar shielding and integrated experimental injectors of adrenaline with a portable protective dialysis device.

ent-STBreacherHelmetM40 = M40 breacher helmet
    .desc = A helmet designed for USCM breacher specialists. Contains heavy insulation, covered in nomex weave.

ent-STBreacherGlovesM40 = M40 breacher gloves
    .desc = A pair of plated, but nimble, gloves.

ent-STBreacherHammer = N45 battle hammer
    .desc = Heavy hammer with an ergonomic handle and reinforced striking surface.

ent-STBreacherShieldN30 = N30-2 standard defensive shield
    .desc = A heavy shield adept at blocking blunt or sharp objects from connecting with the shield wielder.

ent-STWeaponShotgunXM52 = XM52 experimental breaching scattergun
    .desc = An experimental shotgun model going through testing trials in the USCM. Based on the original XM51 version, the XM52 is a mag-fed, burst pump-action shotgun permanently configured for burst fire, with a re-worked receiver that cannot mount any attachments. It utilizes special lighted 16-gauge breaching rounds which are effective at breaching walls and doors. Users are advised not to employ the weapon against soft or armored targets due to low performance of the shells.

ent-STShellShotgunXM52 = handful of XM52 breaching shells
    .desc = { "" }

ent-STMagazineShotgunXM52 = XM52 magazine (16g)
    .desc = A 16 gauge burst-fire shotgun magazine, loaded with lighted breaching shells.

ent-STBoxShotgunXM52 = box of XM52 breaching shells
    .desc = { "" }

ent-STCrateBoxShotgunXM52 = XM52 ammo crate
    .desc = { "" }

ent-STBreacherSpecEquipmentCase = breacher equipment case
    .desc = A large case containing your M40 experimental armor, N45 battle hammer, N30 defensive shield, and an XM52 breaching scattergun in its holster rig.

        NOTE: You cannot put items back inside this case.

ent-STActionBreacherEnrage = Activate Enrage
    .desc = Activate your M40 experimental armor protocol, giving you a rush of adrenaline for a short duration.
